WEBVTT

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:32.340
(Laughter)

00:12:32.871 --> 00:12:36.141
Bonnie said to the doctor,
"I'm not worried about her not breathing.

00:12:36.165 --> 00:12:38.306
If she can't talk
when she gets to the shore,

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.857
she's going to be pissed off."

00:12:39.881 --> 00:12:45.088
(Laughter)

00:12:45.112 --> 00:12:49.017
But the truth is, all those orations
that I had practiced,

00:12:49.041 --> 00:12:52.917
just to get myself through some
training swims as motivation --

00:12:52.941 --> 00:12:54.409
it wasn't like that.

00:12:54.433 --> 00:12:56.881
It was a very real moment,

00:12:56.905 --> 00:12:58.929
with that crowd, with my team.

00:12:59.368 --> 00:13:01.853
We did it. I didn't do it. We did it.